  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the IIC loan is to finance eligible projects via subloans to eligible enterprises in Paraguay that meet IIC and Visi&#xf3;n Banco&#x2019;s loan eligibility criteria and environmental and labor requirements. Micro and small enterprises in Paraguay require short-, medium- and long-term financing in order to carry out their operations. Financing on appropriate terms will make it possible to generate direct and indirect employment and improve the financial structure of such enterprises, which have limited access to financing with terms of more than one year. Visi&#xf3;n Banco seeks to provide specialized financial services and products for micro and small enterprises throughout Paraguay. Its underlying goal is to promote the social and economic development of middle- and low-income individuals nationwide.</narrative>
  </description>
